  "explanation": "The question asks when 'Admiral Stopford' was born. The sources provide conflicting dates for different individuals with the same surname and title. The first two answers—'11 November 1798' and '23 December 1801'—refer to **Montagu Stopford**, a Royal Navy officer, as confirmed by documents D1S2, D2S1, D3S3, and D5S1. These are distinct valid answers for the same referent. The remaining candidates (5 February 1768, 19 December 1811, and 5th of December 1801) refer to **Robert Stopford** and **Robert Fanshawe Stopford**, different individuals with the same title, and are thus irrelevant to the question about 'Admiral Stopford' as interpreted from the most prominent referent in the sources."
}

